  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 401.06 Proof of continuing education supporting materials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 401.06 “Proof of continuing education supporting materials” means either a certificate of course completion, whether electronic or hard copy, including wallet cards or a course roster certified by the approved seminar provider for the course.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15",
